Package: gpu-switcher
Version: 0.1.0-22
Architecture: all
Priority: optional
Section: utils
Maintainer: wl04 <wl04@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, libgtk-4-1, polkitd, dbus, udev, systemd, pciutils
Description: GUI to switch the primary display adapter (GNOME/Mutter)
 Select which GPU GNOME (Mutter) uses as the primary display adapter.
 The app manages Mutter's udev rule under polkit authorization and
 activates the change via reboot or logout.
